        [{ text: '步骤 → 套路', textStyle: { fontWeight: 600, fontSize: 16 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F5F7FA' } } }, { text: '套路由若干确定的解题步骤按确定顺序组合而成', textStyle: { fontSize: 16 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F5F7FA' } } }, { text: '组合顺序 / 前置', textStyle: { fontSize: 16 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F5F7FA' } } }]]} /></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>术语辨析：套路＝题类的方法结构；需指代题库中用于示范该套路的某一道具体题目时，称为“母题示例题”</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：项目名词与教学关系定义.md §4–§5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 7 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>